WEBVTT

00:07:25.916 --> 00:07:32.396
This person even went so far as to bet us
two of the best bottles of champagne

00:07:32.396 --> 00:07:35.356
that we would never get that to work.

00:07:36.876 --> 00:07:38.436
Two words:

00:07:38.476 --> 00:07:39.636
pay up.

00:07:39.636 --> 00:07:41.836
(Laughter)

00:07:41.836 --> 00:07:45.996
(Applause)

00:07:46.036 --> 00:07:48.916
Pay up, because we did it.

00:07:48.956 --> 00:07:52.236
We took the entire high-tech molecular lab

00:07:52.276 --> 00:07:55.916
to the farmers of Tanzania,
Kenya and Uganda,

00:07:55.956 --> 00:07:57.956
and we called it Tree Lab.

00:07:58.956 --> 00:08:00.116
So what did we do?